  "id": "dexibell-j7",
  "name": "Dexibell COMBO J7",
  "manufacturer": "Dexibell",
  "family": "COMBO",
  "status": "experimental",
  "trust": "local",
  "description": "Dexibell COMBO J7: the tonewheel organ's drawbars and controls and the general controllers its MIDI Implementation receives, the organ on its own channel.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "COMBO J7 MIDI Implementation",
      "notes": "The Received data (PDF pages 1 - 5), read by tools/profiles/dexibell/read-dexibell-midi.mjs from J7_Midi_Implementation_Ver_1.02.pdf (sha256 776c49b4a5cf7baa5bc0d70090c2332a4d7d52489a64fa1d2599296d23038b4f), https://www.dexibell.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/J7_Midi_Implementation_Ver_1.02.pdf, linked from https://www.dexibell.com/en/prodotti/combo-j7/. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/dexibell/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/dexibell/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a block of the document's Received data, sent as its controller: the tonewheel organ's on the variable organChannel (its default, 14, as each block says), the others on the channel variable. Each is received only when its RX setting is on, as its block's note says. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "TW Vibrato Mode (CC 84) prints \"00H = 2nd, 7FH = 3rd\", the percussion harmonic's values, where the VIVO S8's document prints V1 - C3; laid out as printed.",
    "Every drawbar's list of levels (27) prints 60H as \"7\", as it does 70H, and has no level 6: 60H is read as 6, the level its place in the order shows (an inference, written down).",
    "Left out, the performance controllers, bank select and messages that are not settings: Bank Sound Select (CC 0, 32), Modulation (CC 1), Expression (CC 11), Hold (CC 64), Sostenuto (CC 66), Soft (CC 67), All Sounds Off (CC 120), Reset All Controllers (CC 121), All Notes Off (CC 123)."
  ],
  "variables": {
    "channel": 1,
    "organChannel": 14
  },
